{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37931","headline":"途中秋晚送友人归江南 · 崔涂","name":"途中秋晚送友人归江南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"又指烟波算路岐，此生多是厌羇离。\n正逢摇落仍须别，不待登临已合悲。\n里巷半空兵过後，水云初冷鴈来时。\n扁舟未得如君去，空向沧江梦所思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔涂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37931.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37931","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}